        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sci-Fi Setting &amp; World Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant galaxy, major factions wage fierce wars for stellar dominance. As fleet commanders, players command various combat units and strategize across interstellar battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Cards Free Simulator</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards are fully unlocked, no gacha or payment required - pure competitive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on strategic combat where skill determines victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build any deck freely and jump into battle immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics That Revolutionize Traditional Card Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply System</strong>: Each unit deployment consumes precious supplies, balancing risk and reward in resource management, breaking through traditional cost limitations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health System</strong>: Units lose health in combat and are destroyed at zero, capable of participating in multiple battles, eliminating one-shot kill mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redefined Combat Damage</strong>: Unit battles don't harm commanders; only direct attacks reduce influence, creating more dynamic breakthrough and interception gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Deployment System</strong>: Unlimited deployment mechanism - as long as supplies last, continuously expand your fleet to create overwhelming advantages or surprise tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn Phases</strong>: Acquire combat resources, activate tactical preparations, deploy units, place facilities, use support cards, command space fleet battles, post-battle adjustments and redeployment, end turn processing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Make crucial choices between survival and expansion - every supply point matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Configuration</strong>: Multiple unit categories including Human, Mammalian, Arthropod, each with unique tactical characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trait Combinations</strong>: Legion and Fleet trait systems that create powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Timing</strong>: Master optimal moments to play support and tactical cards, controlling the battlefield tempo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Types</strong>: Basic units, large units, support facilities, and more - build diverse tactical systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Battle System</strong>: 2-player and 4-player modes with online, LAN support, and spectating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Management</strong>: Intuitive card collection manager, powerful deck builder, search and filter functions, import/export capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface &amp; Experience</strong>: Modern UI design, full Chinese localization, sound effects and visual support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the galactic battlefield now and experience unprecedented strategic card gameplay! All cards free, fair competition - your tactics decide everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is adapted from an open-source project. Currently in early access with fully playable core mechanics. Full version will continuously add more cards, modes, and features - stay tuned!</i></p>",
