tical preparations, deploy units, place facilities, use support cards, command space fleet battles, post-battle adjustments and redeployment, end turn processing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Make crucial choices between survival and expansion - every supply point matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Configuration</strong>: Multiple unit categories including Human, Mammalian, Arthropod, each with unique tactical characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trait Combinations</strong>: Legion and Fleet trait systems that create powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Timing</strong>: Master optimal moments to play support and tactical cards, controlling the battlefield tempo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Types</strong>: Basic units, large units, support facilities, and more - build diverse tactical systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Battle System</strong>: 2-player and 4-player modes with online, LAN support, and spectating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Management</strong>: Intuitive card collection manager, powerful deck builder, search and filter functions, import/export capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface &amp; Experience</strong>: Modern UI design, full Chinese localization, sound effects and visual support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the galactic battlefield now and experience unprecedented strategic card gameplay! All cards free, fair competition - your tactics decide everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is adapted from an open-source project. Currently in early access with fully playable core mechanics. Full version will continuously add more cards, modes, and features - stay tuned!</i></p>",
